1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
<i>Previously on The Night Shift...</i>

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,800
♪ Upbeat music playing ♪

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,400
MARCUS: We need to bail
before the cops show up.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,300
[laughs]

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,600
{\an8}Relax, man. Nobody's
gonna find us here.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,200
- Did you grab the keys?
- They're in the car.

7
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,900
I can't believe you left
the damn keys in the car.

8
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,100
[door slams]
Running late again, huh?

9
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,800
I was running errands.
The bank was packed.

10
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,500
We're gonna run out of time
if we don't leave right now.
